[[File:Let's Go Pikachu Let's Go Eevee Adventure Start Comic.png|thumb|200px|Pocket Monsters Let's Go! Pikachu Let's Go! Eievui Adventure Start Comic]]
(Japanese: '''{{j|ポケットモンスター Let’s Go! ピカチュウ・Let’s Go! イーブイ冒険開始コミック}}''' ''Pocket Monsters Let's Go! Pikachu Let's Go! {{tt|Eievui|Eevee}} Adventure Start Comic'') is a one-shot {{pkmn|manga}} by [[Kemon Kawamoto]] based on [[Pokémon: Let's Go, Pikachu! and Let's Go, Eevee!]]. It was published in (Japanese: '''{{j|ポケットモンスター Let’s Go! ピカチュウ・Let’s Go! イーブイ 最速クリア冒険ガイド}}''' ''Pocket Monsters Let's Go! Pikachu Let's Go! {{tt|Eievui|Eevee}} Fastest Clear Adventure Guide'') on November 16, 2018. The manga is about {{OBP|Hajime|ASC}} and {{OBP|Satoru|ASC}}, a pair of brothers playing Pokémon: Let's Go, Pikachu! for the first time. It is 17 pages long, including the color cover.

